[7.706362, "i", "sed -n '1,240p' /app/bindnote/LAYOUT.txt && printf '\\n--- GRAMMAR ---\\n' && sed -n '1,300p' /app/bindnote/GRAMMAR.txt\n"]
[7.706861, "o", "sed -n '1,240p' /app/bindnote/LAYOUT.txt && printf '\\n--- GRAMMAR ---\\n' && sed -n '1,300p' /app/bindnote/GRAMMAR.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[7.722066, "o", "Trees\r\n  /app/vatmill     mill CLI\r\n  /app/spoolkit    row scan\r\n  /app/wicksrc     row walk\r\n  /app/pantryc     row emit\r\n  /app/millhint    optional plus-tail trim for noisy traces\r\n  /app/crumbay     etch intake (*.stk)\r\n  /app/shardops/live  bin intake (*.stk), including poison.stk\r\n  /app/loomwell/etch.json\r\n  /app/loomwell/pair.sha\r\n  /app/shardops/bins.json\r\n\r\nShip from /app/Makefile. etch walks crumbay. bin walks live and refreshes pair.sha.\r\n"]
[7.722353, "o", "\r\n--- GRAMMAR ---\r\n"]
[7.723529, "o", "Take lines are space-separated fields:\r\n\r\n  KIND ADDR MODULE FUNC\r\n\r\nKIND is `.` for a named frame or `i` for a fold line.\r\nMODULE may include a `+` tail. Pane `mod` is the MODULE text before `+`.\r\nFUNC is the frame name.\r\n\r\nA pane is `mod!fn` for each kept frame, joined by `|` in file order.\r\n\r\nFold: a KIND `i` line does not emit its own chunk; it belongs to the next named frame.\r\nOmit: MODULE whose `mod` is `[vdso]` or `[vsyscall]` does not emit.\r\n"]
[7.723617, "o", "Reject: KIND `BAD` aborts `bin` with a non-zero status and must not replace a prior success bins.json. `/app/shardops/live/poison.stk` is such a take.\r\n\r\nJSON objects map take basename (strip `.stk`) to pane text. Keys are those basenames only (`p3`, `q9`, `n7`, `s7` among them).\r\n\r\n`/app/loomwell/pair.sha` is sha-256 / sha256 hex (64 lowercase chars) of the shared n7/s7 pane string, one line. It matches `sha256sum` of that pane text.\r\n\r\nTwo `bin` runs with the same live tree write identical `bins.json` bytes.\r\n\r\nHeld-out mill takes (copy into live when checking extra copies):\r\n  `/tests/heldout/h8.stk`  (same pane as n7)\r\n  `/tests/heldout/plus.stk`\r\n  `/tests/heldout/vsys.stk`\r\n"]
[7.723932, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[7.72406, "o", "root@1d0b49d2efba:/app# "]
[7.836954, "i", "printf '\\n--- ELF ---\\n'; xxd -l 16 /app/bin/wickpane; file /app/bin/wickpane; printf '\\n--- GO FILES ---\\n'; find /app -path /app/bin -prune -o -type f \\( -name '*.go' -o -name 'go.mod' \\) -print | sort\n"]
[7.837586, "o", "printf '\\n--- ELF ---\\n'; xxd -l 16 /app/bin/wickpane; file /app/bin/wickpane; printf '\\n--- GO FILES ---\\n'; find /app -path /app/bin -prune -o -type f \\( -name '*.go' -o -name 'go.mod' \\) -print | sort\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
